  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ECC 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember now thy Creator in the days of thy youth, while the evil days come not, nor the years draw nigh, when thou shalt say, I have no pleasure in them;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "While the sun, or the light, or the moon, or the stars, be not darkened, nor the clouds return after the rain:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In the day when the keepers of the house shall tremble, and the strong men shall bow themselves, and the grinders cease because they are few, and those that look out of the windows be darkened,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the doors shall be shut in the streets, when the sound of the grinding is low, and he shall rise up at the voice of the bird, and all the daughters of musick shall be brought low;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Also",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "when",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "they shall be afraid of",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that which is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "high, and fears",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "shall be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in the way, and the almond tree shall flourish, and the grasshopper shall be a burden, and desire shall fail: because man goeth to his long home, and the mourners go about the streets:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or ever the silver cord be loosed, or the golden bowl be broken, or the pitcher be broken at the fountain, or the wheel broken at the cistern.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then shall the dust return to the earth as it was: and the spirit shall return unto God who gave it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Vanity of vanities, saith the preacher; all",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "vanity.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And moreover, because the preacher was wise, he still taught the people knowledge; yea, he gave good heed, and sought out,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "and",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "set in order many proverbs.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The preacher sought to find out acceptable words: and",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that which was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "written",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "was",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "upright,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "even",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "words of truth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The words of the wise",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as goads, and as nails fastened",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "by",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the masters of assemblies,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "which",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "are given from one shepherd.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And further, by these, my son, be admonished: of making many books",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "there is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "no end; and much study",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a weariness of the flesh.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ Let us hear the conclusion of the whole matter: Fear God, and keep his commandments: for this",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the whole",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "duty",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "of man.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For God shall bring every work into judgment, with every secret thing, whether",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "good, or whether",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "it be",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "ECC.12.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "evil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.12.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
